WEBVTT
NOTE Meeting date: 2024-03-20

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Maya: Welcome everyone to the GreenHub planning meeting.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Leo: We need a clear fundraiser target and a venue.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Priya: The target is two thousand dollars for native tree seedlings.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Maya: Decision: partner with Riverside Nursery for native seedlings.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Jonah: I will bring tables, signs, and the printed task list.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Sam: The venue is GreenHub Hall, 14 River Street, upstairs room.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Priya: Setup starts at 17:30 and the meeting starts at 18:30.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Maya: Decision: the fundraiser target is $2,000.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Leo: The printing budget question is still open.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Maya: Decision: spend up to $150 on signs and printing.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Priya: Volunteer signup closes on Sunday 17 March at 18:00.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Jonah: Eleven volunteers have signed up.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Maya: Action item: Priya will bring the cash box and receipt book.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Sam: Action item: I will collect seedlings at 16:45.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Leo: Action item: I will update the online announcement.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Priya: Action item: Jonah will update the shared task list.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:41.000
Maya: Please use the shared plan for volunteers and deadlines.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.000
Leo: We should print fifty flyers, not one hundred.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:53.000
Maya: Decision: print fifty flyers within the $150 budget.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Sam: The hall has six folding tables available.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Priya: Action item: Sam will take photos at the market stall.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Jonah: The shared doc is https://docs.example.org/greenhub-plan.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:17.000
Maya: Action item: everyone should bring a reusable water bottle.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:23.000
Leo: What was decided about the fundraiser?

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:29.000
Maya: Riverside Nursery, the $2,000 target, and the market stall.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.000
Priya: Setup is in the upstairs room at GreenHub Hall.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:41.000
Sam: Action item: collect seedlings before setup begins.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:47.000
Jonah: Action item: bring the printed task list and signs.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:53.000
Maya: Decision: our next check-in is Monday 25 March at 18:00 online.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:59.000
Priya: The market stall raised $640 in the first morning.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:05.000
Leo: I will post the first sales update.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:11.000
Maya: Action item: Jonah will update the shared doc with sales totals.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:17.000
Sam: We have a clear plan for the fundraiser.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:23.000
Maya: Thanks everyone; meeting closed.
